<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38376" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔπαυλ-ις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>steading,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.111
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἀσφαλὲς λέοντι καὶ προβάτοις
					ὁμοῦ ποιεῖσθαι τὴν ἔπαυλιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					5.35.13
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.1284
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>farm-building, country house,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				12.43
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pomp.</u>
				24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				6.1
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in
			military language, <i>quarters,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. ποιεῖσθαι</span> en<i>camp,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				2.149c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ στρατοπεδείᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					16.15.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>unwalled village,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Le.</u>
				25.31
			</span></i>,al.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
